- **What's in the way:** the agent loses track of the task ("context rot and memory gets botched") and calls the wrong agent ("It sent a placeholder to the wrong agent thread"). Working out what happened means digging through traces, and you can't tell whether a task really finished, so you don't trust it. Wasted threads cost money.
